pet-ukkeli.c, vic20-iso.c and plus4-stripes.c are example pictures from Marq's PETSCII editor
(http://www.kameli.net/marq/?page_id=2717, petscii.zip examples/), WTFPL like the editor
(see third_party/marq-petscii-LICENSE.txt). A PET picture is saved with its characters only.
plus4-stripes.c is a Plus/4 picture: border, background and colours are whole TED colours (0-127).
